  "learningJourneyHadithEssentialsDescription": "Use a calm beginner path that explains what hadith is, how to start, and how review strengthens understanding.",
  "learningJourneyHadithEssentialsOutcome1": "Understand why hadith matters in daily Muslim life",
  "learningJourneyHadithEssentialsOutcome2": "Start with foundational collections and themes",
  "learningJourneyHadithEssentialsOutcome3": "Use review as reinforcement instead of random browsing",
  "learningJourneyHadithEssentialsWhyThisMatters": "Hadith grounds everyday practice, character, and understanding of prophetic guidance.",
  "learningJourneySalahFoundationsTitle": "Salah Foundations",
