  "learningJourneyDailyWisdomOutcome2": "Connect daily inspiration to deeper journeys.",
  "learningJourneyDailyWisdomOutcome3": "Keep learning alive through small, steady moments.",
  "learningJourneyDailyWisdomWhyThisMatters": "Small, consistent reminders are often more sustainable than long bursts of learning.",
