  "learningJourneyStoriesSignsOutcome3": "Turn observation into remembrance and humility.",
  "learningJourneyStoriesSignsWhyThisMatters": "Allah repeatedly calls us to reflect on creation so our hearts soften, our minds awaken, and our gratitude grows.",
