  "salahTrainerStepNiyyahTranslation": "Intention is in the heart. Make a quiet intention for the prayer you are beginning.",
  "salahTrainerStepTakbirTranslation": "Allah is the Greatest.",
  "salahTrainerStepOpeningSupplicationTranslation": "Glory is to You, O Allah, and praise. Blessed is Your Name, exalted is Your majesty, and none has the right to be worshipped besides You.",
  "salahTrainerStepFatihahTranslation": "Recite Surah al-Fatihah with calmness and reflection in every rakah.",
  "salahTrainerStepAdditionalSurahTranslation": "Recite one short surah from your learned surah pool after al-Fatihah in the first two rakahs.",
  "salahTrainerStepQunutTranslation": "O Allah, guide me among those You have guided, grant me well-being among those You have granted well-being, take me into Your care among those You have taken into Your care, bless for me what You have given, and protect me from the evil of what You have decreed. Indeed, You decree and none can decree over You.",
  "salahTrainerStepRukuTranslation": "Glory is to my Lord, the Magnificent.",
  "salahTrainerStepStandingAfterRukuTranslation": "Allah hears the one who praises Him. Our Lord, and to You belongs all praise.",
  "salahTrainerStepSujudTranslation": "Glory is to my Lord, the Most High.",
  "salahTrainerStepSittingBetweenSujudTranslation": "My Lord, forgive me, have mercy on me, guide me, strengthen me, grant me well-being, and provide for me.",
  "salahTrainerStepTashahhudTranslation": "All greetings, prayers, and pure words belong to Allah. Peace be upon you, O Prophet, and the mercy of Allah and His blessings. Peace be upon us and upon the righteous servants of Allah. I bear witness that there is no god except Allah, and I bear witness that Muhammad is His servant and Messenger.",
  "salahTrainerStepSalawatTranslation": "O Allah, send prayers upon Muhammad and upon the family of Muhammad as You sent prayers upon Ibrahim and the family of Ibrahim; indeed, You are Praiseworthy and Glorious. O Allah, bless Muhammad and the family of Muhammad as You blessed Ibrahim and the family of Ibrahim; indeed, You are Praiseworthy and Glorious.",
  "salahTrainerStepFinalDuaTranslation": "O Allah, I seek refuge in You from the punishment of Hell, the punishment of the grave, the trials of life and death, and the evil trial of the false messiah.",
  "salahTrainerStepTaslimTranslation": "Peace and the mercy of Allah be upon you.",
